    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You transform up to ten creatures of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw to resist the transformation. An unwilling shapechanger automatically succeeds on the save.\nEach target assumes a beast form of your choice, as if the Polymorph creation was used on them, lasting until the end of the duration, or until their individual hit points in their beast forms reach 0.</p>",
